-**A green build is not a rolled dev.** The build ends at the pin commit. dev has rolled once its
-controller Deployment names the build's `dev-<n>` and has finished rolling out:
-
-```bash
-cexec iac kubectl -n kubecoder-dev get deploy kubecoder-controller \
-  -o jsonpath='{.spec.template.spec.containers[?(@.name=="kubecoder-controller")].image}{"\n"}'
-cexec iac kubectl -n kubecoder-dev rollout status deploy/kubecoder-controller --timeout=10m
